{
  "schema": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Timing fixtures for deep_negative_shops. Every one is a thin #include wrapper",
    "around the live filter, so none can drift out of sync with it.",
    "ctl-a/ctl-b are a byte-identical pair and MUST read 1.000x +/- 0.5%. If they do",
    "not, register allocation is not controlled and no other ratio is readable.",
    "On NVIDIA the build pins -cl-nv-maxrregcount=128 automatically.",
    "Counts are 8x the rtx5080 launch width (43008 lanes)."
  ],
  "profiles": {
    "diag-ctl": [
      "diag_ctl"
    ],
    "diag-packs": [
      "diag_ctl",
      "diag_packs"
    ],
    "diag-chunk": [
      "diag_ctl",
